<title>USA: Diametrics starts shipping blood analyzer.</title>
<headline>Diametrics starts shipping blood analyzer.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said it it started shipping its IRMARSL second-generation bedside blood analyzer.</p>
<p>&quot;We achieved our commitment to ship IRMARSL by the end of the third quarter,&quot; said chief executive David Giddings.</p>
<p>Diametrics develops and markets blood analysis systems.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
